    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "Let $f(x)=8x+5$. Find $f^{-1}(x)$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$f^{-1}(x)=\\dfrac{x-5}{8}$.",
      "worked": "Write $y=8x+5$. Interchange $x$ and $y$ to obtain $x=8y+5$.\n$$\\begin{align*}8y&=x-5\\\\y&=\\frac{x-5}{8}\\\\f^{-1}(x)&=\\frac{x-5}{8}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
